[h2]0.10.0 — School, hospital and connection fixes[/h2]
[list]
[*]Technical School students now reconsider food, water, sleep and work between short study visits. Training progress is preserved when they leave or the school is paused.
[*]Fixed building passage reconnection after removing and replacing buildings. Workerless buildings with normal entrances can connect; tubeway stations keep their native transport routes.
[*]Fixed a radioactive-water crash when pumping nearly empty columns or selectively removing badwater.
[*]Hospitals use Medicine only for contamination and radiation treatment. Ordinary injury and chipped-teeth care, and neighborhood wellbeing, do not require Medicine.
[*]Hospital badwater decontamination uses twice the Decontamination Pod's treatment rate at full staffing and power. A medicine-shortage status identifies when medical treatment cannot continue.
[*]Operating supplies now appear as native input inventory rows with capacities and consumption tooltips. Removed the lengthy operating-supply and workforce-risk text panels.
[/list]
